 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bqbscDEb_0gQ7kNvwFWlXEU&_nc_oc=Adqagp0KRzJvuvYjc9v1EsM91srowWs3WJZCIl_a1gKTCcelKrcBaDaxDZXXSMirP2k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJBQuK9O_TrOjQFN2Vxjap3rsiWIQXsmOVQo4pq_2ZmoA&oe=6ABA8541"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JrB77YIwoc8Q7kNvwGpZ-qx&_nc_oc=Adq3yKH8FFHI8Mwsl__4wckcrYvdl-Dnl-UFEqXL_VgaUieMe22516WMhLSXh0HP1LU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL9vVXDWfzfVduwFrC25neJBhyqQHzRqAEnOZtEIeGuAQ&oe=6ABA5A66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T7xTGszljKsQ7kNvwHCsum7&_nc_oc=AdrsoLyhtmEd3ON1A203tNQEW4JcrkCvLrSxzTVvpDH0g2Jnzmq3y31Plue577ygfUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLGV0Mu0cvXb8Fx8sHYlK7Qua6WDc1du8A0DY8qyiPDFA&oe=6ABA645C"}, {"fil